      "content": "Your exhaustion is understandable when the world feels overwhelming, but consider that resting instead of fighting is often more sustainable than thrashing against a current you cannot control. Sometimes choosing to wait for a ship to appear rather than fighting to swim is a smart, necessary strategy for survival. If you could, reaching out to a medical professional to check your weight or vitamin levels might be the most direct way to see if your body just needs something simple to feel anchored. Please consider speaking with a doctor at your next appt about this weariness.",
